  "body": "Implement the user-approved screen-first image coverage contract.\\n\\nScope:\\n- Separate runtime, production-reference, and release images.\\n- Derive coverage from actual Godot scenes, resource consumers, states, and expression method.\\n- Add a machine-checkable audit for existing current runtime image consumers.\\n- Do not generate duplicate raster assets where procedural Godot/theme expression is the active consumer.\\n\\nAcceptance:\\n- All current consumer-bound PNG paths resolve.\\n- Unit state fallback coverage is verified.\\n- Planned but unimplemented screens are explicitly deferred, not misclassified as missing runtime assets.",
